# The foes' plans in the editor (#13466), for coax drive (docs/editor/acceptance/README.md, "Foes").
# Start from an empty world on the dev server. Size 1280x800, query "edit&stage=5", --real-time: each edit
# verb fails the run unless the world takes it and the page stands at its revision; `state` shows the rest.
clock +3000
state page.f.rev
type - key Enter
clock +800
type - key Escape
# what the agent reads first: the time of day, the actors by name, each one's four plans and the places
foes
# the editor's time of day: dusk. The light and every foe follow it, and play is not changed
time dusk
clock +500
state game.view
# two robots stand guard at the tunnel mouth: a plan with no route takes its old one, cut to fit
plan 6 dusk guard
route 6 dusk -200 -3700, 0 -3100
plan 7 dusk guard --on call
route 7 dusk 200 -3700, 0 -3100
# the raiders circle the party floor at dusk: a patrol of four points
plan 1 dusk patrol
route 1 dusk 150 -3100, 0 -1900, -150 -3100, 0 -4300
# pick an actor: its route and notice ring are drawn, and the inspector shows its plan
tap actor.6
clock +500
state page.actor
screenshot apps/openagents-web/build/foes-dusk.png
# Simulate: the foes run their plans with no player
tap sim
clock +4000
screenshot apps/openagents-web/build/foes-simulate.png
tap sim
# dawn: the same actor, its dawn plan
time dawn
clock +500
state game.view
tap actor.1
clock +500
state page.actor
screenshot apps/openagents-web/build/foes-dawn.png
# undo walks the eight edits back, one a step; then the story's own clock
undo
undo
undo
undo
undo
undo
undo
undo
time story
clock +500
state game.view
logs
